  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed two-storey side extension, by reason of its excessive scale, bulk, massing and design, including its alignment with the existing front building line, matching ridge and eaves heights, proximity to the side boundary and replication of the host dwelling's front gable feature, would not appear as a subordinate addition to the original dwelling. Instead, it would compete with and overwhelm the host property, resulting in an overly dominant and visually intrusive form of development that would harm the character and appearance of both the dwelling and the surrounding street scene. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy D4 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD6, DMD14 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
  ],
